{"duration": 18.92, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 5.4, "text": "Sevengill sharks, which earlier surveys\nhad never recorded at the island,"}, {"start": 5.4, "end": 10.2, "text": "began to appear. Reported sightings\nof Cape fur seals around the bay"}, {"start": 10.2, "end": 16.06, "text": "went up about six times. The fish\nthat seals eat became harder to find,"}, {"start": 16.06, "end": 18.92, "text": "and so did the small sharks\nthat sevengills hunt."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.74, "text": "Sevengill"}, {"start": 0.74, "end": 1.22, "text": "sharks,"}, {"start": 1.72, "end": 1.96, "text": "which"}, {"start": 1.96, "end": 2.48, "text": "earlier"}, {"start": 2.48, "end": 3.0, "text": "surveys"}, {"start": 3.0, "end": 3.3, "text": "had"}, {"start": 3.3, "end": 3.64, "text": "never"}, {"start": 3.64, "end": 4.18, "text": "recorded"}, {"start": 4.18, "end": 4.42, "text": "at"}, {"start": 4.42, "end": 4.58, "text": "the"}, {"start": 4.58, "end": 5.02, "text": "island,"}, {"start": 5.4, "end": 5.76, "text": "began"}, {"start": 5.76, "end": 6.06, "text": "to"}, {"start": 6.06, "end": 6.6, "text": "appear."}, {"start": 7.7, "end": 7.7, "text": "Reported"}, {"start": 7.7, "end": 8.22, "text": "sightings"}, {"start": 8.22, "end": 8.54, "text": "of"}, {"start": 8.54, "end": 8.7, "text": "Cape"}, {"start": 8.7, "end": 9.02, "text": "fur"}, {"start": 9.02, "end": 9.3, "text": "seals"}, {"start": 9.3, "end": 9.72, "text": "around"}, {"start": 9.72, "end": 9.88, "text": "the"}, {"start": 9.88, "end": 10.2, "text": "bay"}, {"start": 10.2, "end": 10.52, "text": "went"}, {"start": 10.52, "end": 10.9, "text": "up"}, {"start": 10.9, "end": 11.3, "text": "about"}, {"start": 11.3, "end": 11.76, "text": "six"}, {"start": 11.76, "end": 12.46, "text": "times."}, {"start": 13.04, "end": 13.18, "text": "The"}, {"start": 13.18, "end": 13.4, "text": "fish"}, {"start": 13.4, "end": 13.66, "text": "that"}, {"start": 13.66, "end": 14.08, "text": "seals"}, {"start": 14.08, "end": 14.38,